3. PLANS
----------------------------------------------------------------------

  Startup     Up to three (3) Developers and one (1) product or internal
              tool.

  Business    Up to twenty (20) Developers. Unlimited products, internal
              tools and client projects.

  Lifetime    The rights of the Business Plan, bought with a single payment.
              Every version of the Software the Licensor releases, at any
              time, is a Licensed Version.

  Enterprise  Limits, support and terms as agreed in writing with the
              Licensor.

Plan limits are not enforced by the Software; they are a condition of this
Agreement. A Licensee that outgrows its Plan must upgrade within thirty (30)
days. Fees, currency and current Plan descriptions are those published at
https://faithdevss.github.io/richkit/pricing at the time of purchase.

On reasonable written notice, and no more than once in any twelve-month
period, the Licensor may ask the Licensee to confirm in writing that its use
is within its Plan.


----------------------------------------------------------------------
4. LICENSE KEY
----------------------------------------------------------------------

The Licensor issues each Licensee a License Key. The Licensee must configure
the Software with it for Production Use. The key is verified locally, inside
the Licensee's application; the Software makes no network call, activation or
telemetry request to the Licensor.

Without a valid License Key, the Software shows a small "unlicensed" notice
on production hosts. It does not stop working, block editing, or alter
documents.

The License Key is confidential to the Licensee, except as necessarily
embedded in the Licensee's own applications. The Licensee may not share it
with any other entity.


----------------------------------------------------------------------
5. EVALUATION
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Anyone may use the Software free of charge on development hosts (such as
localhost) for evaluation and development, without a License Key.

Anyone may also make Production Use of the Software without a License Key
for up to thirty (30) consecutive days to evaluate it, with the unlicensed
notice displayed. After that period the entity must either purchase a
license or cease Production Use of the Software.


----------------------------------------------------------------------
6. TERM, FEES, AND PERPETUAL FALLBACK
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Startup and Business Plans are annual subscriptions. While a subscription is
active, the Licensor issues renewed License Keys covering new releases.

If a subscription lapses or is cancelled, the Licensee retains a perpetual,
irrevocable license under Section 2 to continue using, and to continue
shipping in already-released and future products, every Licensed Version.
Its License Key continues to work with those versions. The Licensee has no
right to versions released after its License Key's "updates until" date.

The Lifetime Plan does not expire, and its License Key covers every version
the Licensor releases.

The Licensor is not obliged to continue developing, maintaining or releasing
the Software, for any Plan. If the Licensor stops releasing new versions, or
discontinues the Software, every license already granted continues under
these terms: all Licensed Versions remain licensed, and License Keys continue
to work with them, because they are verified without contacting the Licensor.
Discontinuation does not entitle any Licensee to a refund.

Refunds are available as described in the refund policy at
https://faithdevss.github.io/richkit/refunds, and otherwise only where
required by law. A refund ends the license and its License Key.


